OL,5,G1700 Shoplifters: Caught Red Handed
OL,6,     FIn Newton Abbot, undercover
OL,7,     Fdetective Nush spots a suspicious
OL,8,     Fcharacter in the crowds. She tails
OL,9,     Fthe suspect into a card shop but
OL,10,     Fthere's a problem - the suspect
OL,11,     Fhas disappeared.
OL,12,G1800 Home and Away
OL,13,     FSonny's problems snowball.
OL,14,     FAbigail's grudge backfires. Beau
OL,15,     Fflexes his grip on Sonny.
OL,16,G1830 Home and Away
OL,17,     FAmelia goes the extra mile. Sonny
OL,18,     Fneeds money fast. Mackenzie uses
OL,19,     Fwork as a distraction.
