OL,5,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FThe surgery visits Peterborough.
OL,7,     FRichard, who has cracked a rib or
OL,8,     Ftwo, comes in to see Dr David
OL,9,     FWard. Vera has been suffering
OL,10,     Fexcruciating abdominal pain and is
OL,11,     Fbarely able to move.
OL,12,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,13,     FA high call-out for ambulances has
OL,14,     Fresulted in paramedics queuing
OL,15,     Fwith patients in the corridor at
OL,16,     FBarnsley Casualty. The team must
OL,17,     Fdecide who is seen and who can
OL,18,     Fwait.
